{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24083","headline":"菩提寺上方晚望香山寺寄舒员外 · 白居易","name":"菩提寺上方晚望香山寺寄舒员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晚登西宝刹，晴望东精舍。\n反照转楼台，辉辉似图画。\n冰浮水明灭，雪压松偃亚。\n石阁僧上来，云汀雁飞下。\n西京闹於市，东洛闲如社。\n曾忆旧游无，香山明月夜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24083.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24083","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}